          (Lean_CEK_Ctl_ret_typed (Lean_CEK_Val_lit_node m) (Lean_CEK_Val_lit_typed m Hm)) k Hk).
      exact Lean_CEK_step_eq_2 m Hm r Hr k Hk. }
exact Main.
